{
  "id": "064",
  "title": "The Clever Little Ming",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2016-01-26",
  "synopsis": "Today we read the charming story of how Little Ming escapes homework.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/47/4edf39c2467eacbc04eff8cdb79aab302e6c2b8f.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "聪明的小明\n\n    今天放学后，小明跑出教室，拉着妈妈的手就跑。\n    妈妈问他：“为什么跑那么快？”\n    小明说：“老师今天忘记布置作业了。快跑！等老师想起来她忘了布置作业，我们已经跑远了，她就没办法了。”",
    "traditional": "聰明的小明\n\n    今天放學後，小明跑出教室，拉著媽媽的手就跑。\n    媽媽問他：“為什麼跑那麼快？”\n    小明說：“老師今天忘記佈置作業了。快跑！等老師想起來她忘了佈置作業，我們已經跑遠了，她就沒辦法了。”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The Clever Little Ming"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "今天放学后，小明跑出教室，拉着妈妈的手就跑。",
      "traditional": "今天放學後，小明跑出教室，拉著媽媽的手就跑。",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān fàng xué hòu xiǎo míng pǎo chū jiào shì lā zhe mā ma de shǒu jiù pǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Today after school, Little Ming burst out of the classroom and just ran, pulling his mom's hand."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "妈妈问他：“为什么跑那么快？”\n",
      "traditional": "媽媽問他：“為什麼跑那麼快？”\n",
      "pinyin": "mā ma wèn tā wèi shén me pǎo nà me kuài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "    ",
      "traditional": "    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom asked him: “Why are you running so fast?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小明说：“老师今天忘记布置作业了。快跑！",
      "traditional": "小明說：“老師今天忘記佈置作業了。快跑！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng shuō lǎo shī jīn tiān wàng jì bù zhì zuò yè le kuài pǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "等老师想起来她忘了布置作业，我们已经跑远了，她就没办法了。”",
      "traditional": "等老師想起來她忘了佈置作業，我們已經跑遠了，她就沒辦法了。”",
      "pinyin": "děng lǎo shī xiǎng qǐ lái tā wàng le bù zhì zuò yè wǒ men yǐ jīng pǎo yuǎn le tā jiù méi bàn fǎ le",
      "english": "Little Ming said: “Today, the teacher forgot to hand out homework. Run quickly!”"
    }
  ],
